WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:08.000
Reedy explores first-period care through a connected product and app concept.

00:08.000 --> 00:16.000
A guided start with the product, through a proposed QR-code setup experience.

00:16.000 --> 00:24.000
See today's information and revisit past cycles through the app's period-history concept.

00:24.000 --> 00:32.000
A four-week project, from sketches to a color-sensor prototype. This is not clinically validated.
